From t.jombart at imperial.ac.uk  Wed Jan 16 00:40:24 2013
From: t.jombart at imperial.ac.uk (Jombart, Thibaut)
Date: Tue, 15 Jan 2013 23:40:24 +0000
Subject: [adegenet-forum] Any suggestions about conducting a 3-D sPCA?
